   "sourceHash": "8e13ec3b028c441ab9ce4ac985b13761e73e4ad48a47e649577669c98af6651f",
   "text": "준비물: 면 소재 의류, 복용 중인 약, 최근 검사 결과지, 그리고 열린 마음",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3cdcc1afb9511bc71bd1",
   "sourceHash": "3cdcc1afb9511bc71bd123a951fdb1e4f7e9f0ba741b902b434a30b8f6b9f211",
   "text": "방문객 [[OPEN_1]]경험담[[CLOSE_1]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'Guest' rendered as '방문객' (visitor) per clinical language lock."
   ]
  },
  {
